#!/usr/bin/env deque
// A talk about deque, made with deque: every effect it has, each slide showing
// the line that made it. Run it: deque demo/talk.deque (or ./talk.deque).

---
fx: assemble
then: shine sparkle

# DEQUE
// run deque notes demo/talk.deque in another terminal to see these
**slides in your terminal**

{muted}enter or → on · b back · q quit{/}

---
fx: scramble

## why
# WHY
> a talk is a text file. {muted}diff it, grep it, commit it.{/}
> headlines are text. {muted}no pasted ascii art.{/}
> every effect is one line. {muted}or none.{/}

