lines: glide

## a whole slide
# HOW
```
`---`
`fx: scramble`

`## why`         {muted}the label{/}
`# WHY`          {muted}the headline{/}
`there at once`  {muted}a line{/}
`> on a key`     {muted}a step{/}
```

