draw: 76x14

## how a slide arrives
step
box 3,0 6x3 {accent}tr
text 7,1 old slide
text 8,1 {muted}leaves{/}
step
arrow 4,13 4,14
box 3,16 12x3 {accent}fx
text 7,17 headline
text 8,17 {muted}arrives{/}
step
arrow 4,29 4,30
box 3,32 12x3 {accent}lines
text 7,33 lines
text 8,33 {muted}arrive{/}
step
arrow 4,45 4,46
box 3,48 12x3 {accent}reveal
text 7,49 each step
text 8,49 {muted}per key{/}
step
arrow 4,61 4,62
box 3,64 12x3 {accent}then
text 7,65 flourish
text 8,65 {muted}at the end{/}
step
center 11 **all optional · per slide, or for the whole talk**

